    "title": "Post by @skalskip92",
    "markdown": "> `@GeminiApp`\n> The moment you've been waiting 4…\n>\n> Our new frontier model, Gemini 4 Argon, is rolling out now in the Gemini app to bring your most complex ideas into reality.\n>\n> See how Gemini 4 Argon and our latest updates across the Gemini app help you get the most out of every prompt. 🧵\n>\n> *[video]*\n\nAstra dethroned\n\nGemini 4 Argon is the best \"vision\" model\n\n#1 for detection:\n\n- tight, precise boxes\n- dense scenes\n\n#1 for text extraction:\n\n- small text\n- handwritten text\n- complex tables\n- rotated text\n\n4× cheaper than Astra at high\n\n*[image]*\n\n---\n\nObject Detection\n\n#1 for high and low efforts\n\nhigh:\n\n- Argon 85.1%\n- Astra 83.6%\n\nlow:\n\n- Argon 82.5%\n- Astra 82.1%\n\nlink: https://playground.roboflow.com/evals/object-detection\n\n*[image]*\n\n---\n\nlego pieces\n\ntry Astra vs Argon in playground: https://playground.roboflow.com/share/39a9ef79-142a-423c-925e-1d79dbcfe09a\n\n*[image]*\n\n---\n\nbottle caps\n\n*[image]*\n\n---\n\ncarrots\n\n*[image]*\n\n---\n\nSingle String Extraction\n\n#1 for high and low efforts\n\nhigh:\n\n- Argon 80.0%\n- Claude Fable 5 72.2%\n\nlow:\n\n- Argon 78.3%\n- Gemini 3.7 Flash 74.8%\n\nlink: https://playground.roboflow.com/evals/ocr\n\n*[image]*\n\n---\n\nmechanical electricity meter\n\n*[image]*\n\n---\n\nlicense plates at night\n\n*[image]*\n\n---\n\ndigital scale upside down\n\n*[image]*\n\n---\n\ncode engraved on worn metal\n\n*[image]*\n\n---\n\nText Localization and Recognition\n\n#1 for high and low efforts\n\nhigh:\n\n- Argon 84.7%\n- Astra 76.8%\n\nlow:\n\n- Argon 81.6%\n- Astra 75.5%\n\nlink: https://playground.roboflow.com/evals/ocr\n\n*[image]*\n\n---\n\ncircuit board\n\n*[image]*\n\n---\n\ntechnical drawing\n\n*[image]*\n\n---\n\nJSON Extraction\n\n#1 for high and low efforts\n\nhigh:\n\n- Argon 94.8%\n- Astra 91.7%\n\nlow:\n\n- Argon 92.6%\n- Astra 91.8%\n\nlink: https://playground.roboflow.com/evals/ocr\n\n*[image]*\n\n---\n\nhandwritten weather table